00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:32,820
When I dance with people, I see them smile and laugh.

244
00:21:33,440 --> 00:21:35,960
It makes me truly excited.

245
00:21:38,040 --> 00:21:42,420
Hi, I'm working on a book about my travels.

246
00:21:43,220 --> 00:21:49,660
I've had the pleasure to see a lot more of the world than anyone my age could

247
00:21:49,660 --> 00:21:51,080
reasonably hope to.

248
00:21:51,080 --> 00:21:59,700
A few years ago, on a vacation trip, I made a video of myself dancing wildly in

249
00:21:59,700 --> 00:22:03,460
foreign places. I put it on the internet.

250
00:22:03,460 --> 00:22:10,720
Some friends started passing it around, and soon millions of people watched it.

251
00:22:11,060 --> 00:22:18,320
I was offered money to continue my travels, and since then I've made two more videos

252
00:22:18,320 --> 00:22:23,700
that include 70 countries on all seven continents.

253
00:22:24,660 --> 00:22:32,500
A lot of people wanted to dance along with me, so I started inviting them to join in

254
00:22:32,500 --> 00:22:33,920
everywhere I went.

255
00:22:34,880 --> 00:22:37,100
Here's what I can report back.

256
00:22:37,100 --> 00:22:41,120
People want to feel connected to each other.

257
00:22:41,200 --> 00:22:44,160
They want to be heard and seen.

258
00:22:44,760 --> 00:22:50,560
And they're curious to hear and see others from places far away.

259
00:22:50,560 --> 00:22:53,120
I share that idea.

260
00:22:53,720 --> 00:22:56,740
It's exactly what drives me to travel.

261
00:22:57,660 --> 00:23:02,420
When I dance with people, I see them smile and laugh.

262
00:23:02,760 --> 00:23:05,340
It makes me truly excited.

263
